  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ID_3163_151">
    <VALUE Lang="id">When Bike is summoned, it would be possible to change the colors of the bike by parts using this item with right mouse button.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ID_3163_152">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Using this item will recharge battery by 50% when currently using bike's battery gauge hits '0' or is almost at '0'. Un-equip the Bike to inventory and then click right mouse button on the bike when Battery Item is selected.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ID_3163_153">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Using this item will recharge battery 100% when currently using bike's battery gauge hits '0' or is almost at '0'. Un-equip the Bike to inventory and then click right mouse button on the bike when Battery Item is selected.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
  <SENTENSE Ver="1" Id="ID_3163_154">
    <VALUE Lang="id">Using this item will recharge battery by 25% when currently using bike's battery gauge hits '0' or is almost at '0'. Un-equip the Bike to inventory and then click right mouse button on the bike when Battery Item is selected.</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
