    <VALUE Lang="id">Collect 10 'Pumpkin Seed[7D]' and 10 'Pumpkin Seed Potion[7D]' can exchange 'Graver'with the NPCs 'Witch' in the MarketPlace</VALUE>
  </SENTENSE>
